 tabs	and   repeated spaces
 line three</pre>
     <p id="inline-space">Inline <strong>formatting</strong> keeps a meaningful boundary.</p>
     <p id="nbsp-comment-sample">NBSP&nbsp;boundary stays together.<br><!-- extractor must ignore this comment -->Second line follows a forced break.</p>
